  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "雪玉洞像大自然养的孩子，石花洞藏着奶油蛋糕般的月奶石，天泉洞地上地下都是宝，龙宫能坐船看瀑布，双河洞探了四十年还没到头。每一个都鬼斧神工。第五到第一更震撼，有一处整条江都被吞进去了#自然景观#地下奇观#中国溶洞#旅行#景点",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_15779fc77ad73396_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 422.301995,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道，中国大地上老天爷亲手凿出来的最不可思议的地下奇观，究竟藏在哪一个角落吗？有人说是湖北腾龙洞中国最大的溶洞，整条清江都被它吞进去了。有人说是重庆芙蓉洞，中国唯一一个被列入世界自然遗产名录的天然洞穴。可您要是真信了，那就被忽悠了。真正霸榜的那个一露脸，他们都得往后站。他被公认为中国溶洞的终极天花板，肚子里锁着一件天下独一份的地下至宝。凡是亲眼见过的人，出来都只剩一句话，看过了，它别的洞再入不了眼。今天咱们就来盘点盘点中国十大鬼斧神工的天然洞穴奇观。可能您去过不少名山大川，可这种藏在地底下几百万年的东西，看一回少一回。老规矩开讲之前，劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，让我看看都是谁在听第十名。重庆雪域洞在重庆丰都长江对岸龙和峡谷的岩壁之上，全长一千六百四十四米。这洞最绝的是他年轻是国内已开发洞穴里最年轻的一个，而且还在生长一般洞穴沉积物一百年才长一毫米，雪玉洞一年涨零点三三毫米，比别的地方快了三十多倍。洞内百分之八十的钟乳石，洁白如雪，志纯似玉，所以叫雪欲冻。这里的钟乳时，年龄大多在三千三百年到一万年之间，相当于人类的十几岁。别的溶洞是老爷爷，她是个小姑娘，浑身雪白，晶莹剔透。您说这是溶洞，还是大自然养的一个孩子？第九名，北京石花洞在北京房山发现于明朝正统十一年，开发于二十世纪八十年代，是中国第一座以岩溶洞穴自然景观为主体的地质公园。这洞最绝的是洞层多，一共有八层，一层叠一层，像一栋八层楼的地下大厦，全国岩溶洞穴里层数最多。洞里的石盾有两百多个，也是全世界罕见。石花洞里还有一种别处没有的东西叫月乃石，外表坚硬，里面是柔软的粉末状物质，乳白色像奶酪。全国首次发现，专家们认为可能跟细菌作用有关。您想想一块石头，外面硬里面软，只在石花洞里有。您说这是石头还是大地的奶油蛋糕？第八名，四川兴闻十海天泉洞在四川宜宾兴文县这洞最绝的是他大已经探明长度十点五公里，上下四层，现开放，主动约三公里，总面积八万多平方米，空间规模和游览长度都居世界洞穴之首。天泉洞跟景区内的世界第一大漏斗，还有大型地表石海三绝共生，构成了世界级的喀斯特景观，地上是一片石头，海洋石林石峰从地里冒出来，地下是天泉洞，洞庭里藏着谢玉流光石临仙姿浪漫星河。洞内常年恒温十八度，您站在地表看，是石头长成了海。您钻进地下，看是石头长成了宫殿。您说这是景区，还是老天爷在地上地下各藏了一座宝库？第七名，贵州安顺龙宫在贵州安顺这洞最绝的是它是中国第一水溶洞，全长十五公里，是中国最长的水溶洞。水溶洞跟旱洞不一样，您得坐着船进去，船在暗河里走。两边是各种奇形怪状的钟乳石，头顶上终乳垂悬洞，里面还藏着一个瀑布，叫龙门飞瀑。高五十米宽二十五米，是中国最大的洞中瀑布。天池水从龙门倾泻而下声震山谷。您想想，在地底下藏着一条河，藏着一条瀑布，您坐在船上，看着瀑布从洞里砸下来。您说，这是溶洞还是地底下的水帘洞？第六名，贵州双河洞在贵州绥阳这洞最绝的是它长。根据最新发布的科考成果，双河洞洞穴系统以探明总长度四百八十一公里，是亚洲第一长洞世界第三长洞，也是全球最长的白云岩洞穴。洞穴系统有上百个洞口，相互连通，垂直落差九百多米。它的长度从一九八七年的十七公里一路刷新到今天的四百八十一公里，到现在还没探到头。专家说，双河洞可能还会更长。您想想一个洞探了快四十年，还没探完亚洲第一世界。第三，您说这是溶洞，还是地球在贵州底下藏了一条走不完的地下长廊？从第十到第六，雪玉洞是个小姑娘，石花洞有八层楼、天权洞、地上地下都是宝，龙宫藏着中国最大的洞中瀑布，双河洞是亚洲第一程度，可这五个还不是最震撼的。接下来第五道第一，一个比一个狠，有一处地方整条江被一个洞吞进去了。有一处地方是中国唯一的世界自然遗产洞穴，可他们还不是最狠的、最狠的那个被公认为中国溶洞的终极天花板，肚子里锁着好几件天下独一份的地下之宝。凡是亲眼见过的人出来都只剩一句话，看过了它别的洞再入不了眼，他是哪儿，他凭什么排第一，下集马上更新，您先点个关注点，开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 690,
      "text": "您知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00002",
      "start_ms": 690,
      "end_ms": 6570,
      "text": "中国大地上老天爷亲手凿出来的最不可思议的地下奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7110,
      "end_ms": 9610,
      "text": "究竟藏在哪一个角落吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10150,
      "end_ms": 14110,
      "text": "有人说是湖北腾龙洞中国最大的溶洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00005",
      "start_ms": 14690,
      "end_ms": 17390,
      "text": "整条清江都被它吞进去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00006",
      "start_ms": 18350,
      "end_ms": 20270,
      "text": "有人说是重庆芙蓉洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20630,
      "end_ms": 26130,
      "text": "中国唯一一个被列入世界自然遗产名录的天然洞穴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00008",
      "start_ms": 27030,
      "end_ms": 28590,
      "text": "可您要是真信了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00009",
      "start_ms": 28910,
      "end_ms": 29905,
      "text": "那就被忽悠了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00010",
      "start_ms": 31270,
      "end_ms": 33830,
      "text": "真正霸榜的那个一露脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00011",
      "start_ms": 33850,
      "end_ms": 34970,
      "text": "他们都得往后站。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35690,
      "end_ms": 38730,
      "text": "他被公认为中国溶洞的终极天花板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00013",
      "start_ms": 38790,
      "end_ms": 42450,
      "text": "肚子里锁着一件天下独一份的地下至宝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00014",
      "start_ms": 42910,
      "end_ms": 44730,
      "text": "凡是亲眼见过的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00015",
      "start_ms": 45130,
      "end_ms": 46630,
      "text": "出来都只剩一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00016",
      "start_ms": 47350,
      "end_ms": 47890,
      "text": "看过了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47890,
      "end_ms": 50350,
      "text": "它别的洞再入不了眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00018",
      "start_ms": 51490,
      "end_ms": 57350,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点盘点中国十大鬼斧神工的天然洞穴奇观。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00019",
      "start_ms": 57730,
      "end_ms": 59685,
      "text": "可能您去过不少名山大川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00020",
      "start_ms": 60240,
      "end_ms": 63560,
      "text": "可这种藏在地底下几百万年的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00021",
      "start_ms": 63740,
      "end_ms": 64975,
      "text": "看一回少一回。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00022",
      "start_ms": 65330,
      "end_ms": 67310,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00023",
      "start_ms": 67350,
      "end_ms": 70570,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00024",
      "start_ms": 70810,
      "end_ms": 73865,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00025",
      "start_ms": 74130,
      "end_ms": 80655,
      "text": "重庆雪域洞在重庆丰都长江对岸龙和峡谷的岩壁之上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00026",
      "start_ms": 81000,
      "end_ms": 83125,
      "text": "全长一千六百四十四米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00027",
      "start_ms": 83610,
      "end_ms": 89645,
      "text": "这洞最绝的是他年轻是国内已开发洞穴里最年轻的一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00028",
      "start_ms": 90280,
      "end_ms": 95455,
      "text": "而且还在生长一般洞穴沉积物一百年才长一毫米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00029",
      "start_ms": 95910,
      "end_ms": 98915,
      "text": "雪玉洞一年涨零点三三毫米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00030",
      "start_ms": 99450,
      "end_ms": 101655,
      "text": "比别的地方快了三十多倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00031",
      "start_ms": 102110,
      "end_ms": 104545,
      "text": "洞内百分之八十的钟乳石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00032",
      "start_ms": 105030,
      "end_ms": 106095,
      "text": "洁白如雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00033",
      "start_ms": 106540,
      "end_ms": 107665,
      "text": "志纯似玉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00034",
      "start_ms": 108120,
      "end_ms": 109915,
      "text": "所以叫雪欲冻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00035",
      "start_ms": 111020,
      "end_ms": 112060,
      "text": "这里的钟乳时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00036",
      "start_ms": 112060,
      "end_ms": 115175,
      "text": "年龄大多在三千三百年到一万年之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00037",
      "start_ms": 115620,
      "end_ms": 117325,
      "text": "相当于人类的十几岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00038",
      "start_ms": 117740,
      "end_ms": 119315,
      "text": "别的溶洞是老爷爷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00039",
      "start_ms": 119840,
      "end_ms": 120745,
      "text": "她是个小姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00040",
      "start_ms": 121040,
      "end_ms": 121980,
      "text": "浑身雪白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00041",
      "start_ms": 122140,
      "end_ms": 123045,
      "text": "晶莹剔透。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00042",
      "start_ms": 123470,
      "end_ms": 124835,
      "text": "您说这是溶洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00043",
      "start_ms": 125370,
      "end_ms": 127385,
      "text": "还是大自然养的一个孩子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00044",
      "start_ms": 127950,
      "end_ms": 128525,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00045",
      "start_ms": 128960,
      "end_ms": 133445,
      "text": "北京石花洞在北京房山发现于明朝正统十一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00046",
      "start_ms": 133880,
      "end_ms": 136025,
      "text": "开发于二十世纪八十年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00047",
      "start_ms": 136600,
      "end_ms": 142215,
      "text": "是中国第一座以岩溶洞穴自然景观为主体的地质公园。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00048",
      "start_ms": 142750,
      "end_ms": 145745,
      "text": "这洞最绝的是洞层多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00049",
      "start_ms": 146750,
      "end_ms": 147910,
      "text": "一共有八层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00050",
      "start_ms": 148130,
      "end_ms": 149275,
      "text": "一层叠一层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00051",
      "start_ms": 149620,
      "end_ms": 151875,
      "text": "像一栋八层楼的地下大厦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00052",
      "start_ms": 152760,
      "end_ms": 155545,
      "text": "全国岩溶洞穴里层数最多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00053",
      "start_ms": 156320,
      "end_ms": 158585,
      "text": "洞里的石盾有两百多个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00054",
      "start_ms": 158900,
      "end_ms": 160235,
      "text": "也是全世界罕见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00055",
      "start_ms": 160740,
      "end_ms": 165315,
      "text": "石花洞里还有一种别处没有的东西叫月乃石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00056",
      "start_ms": 165770,
      "end_ms": 166705,
      "text": "外表坚硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00057",
      "start_ms": 167080,
      "end_ms": 169375,
      "text": "里面是柔软的粉末状物质，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00058",
      "start_ms": 169740,
      "end_ms": 171445,
      "text": "乳白色像奶酪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00059",
      "start_ms": 172270,
      "end_ms": 173665,
      "text": "全国首次发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00060",
      "start_ms": 174350,
      "end_ms": 177010,
      "text": "专家们认为可能跟细菌作用有关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00061",
      "start_ms": 177190,
      "end_ms": 179085,
      "text": "您想想一块石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00062",
      "start_ms": 179340,
      "end_ms": 180705,
      "text": "外面硬里面软，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00063",
      "start_ms": 181240,
      "end_ms": 182505,
      "text": "只在石花洞里有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00064",
      "start_ms": 182960,
      "end_ms": 186265,
      "text": "您说这是石头还是大地的奶油蛋糕？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00065",
      "start_ms": 186480,
      "end_ms": 187045,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00066",
      "start_ms": 187590,
      "end_ms": 198155,
      "text": "四川兴闻十海天泉洞在四川宜宾兴文县这洞最绝的是他大已经探明长度十点五公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00067",
      "start_ms": 198400,
      "end_ms": 199375,
      "text": "上下四层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00068",
      "start_ms": 199990,
      "end_ms": 200690,
      "text": "现开放，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00069",
      "start_ms": 200730,
      "end_ms": 202285,
      "text": "主动约三公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00070",
      "start_ms": 202760,
      "end_ms": 204885,
      "text": "总面积八万多平方米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00071",
      "start_ms": 205420,
      "end_ms": 210065,
      "text": "空间规模和游览长度都居世界洞穴之首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00072",
      "start_ms": 210710,
      "end_ms": 213815,
      "text": "天泉洞跟景区内的世界第一大漏斗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00073",
      "start_ms": 214140,
      "end_ms": 217535,
      "text": "还有大型地表石海三绝共生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00074",
      "start_ms": 217890,
      "end_ms": 220245,
      "text": "构成了世界级的喀斯特景观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00075",
      "start_ms": 220720,
      "end_ms": 222020,
      "text": "地上是一片石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00076",
      "start_ms": 222020,
      "end_ms": 225190,
      "text": "海洋石林石峰从地里冒出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00077",
      "start_ms": 225230,
      "end_ms": 226965,
      "text": "地下是天泉洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00078",
      "start_ms": 227370,
      "end_ms": 232465,
      "text": "洞庭里藏着谢玉流光石临仙姿浪漫星河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00079",
      "start_ms": 232940,
      "end_ms": 235285,
      "text": "洞内常年恒温十八度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00080",
      "start_ms": 235650,
      "end_ms": 236995,
      "text": "您站在地表看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00081",
      "start_ms": 237350,
      "end_ms": 238990,
      "text": "是石头长成了海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00082",
      "start_ms": 239210,
      "end_ms": 240210,
      "text": "您钻进地下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00083",
      "start_ms": 240210,
      "end_ms": 242665,
      "text": "看是石头长成了宫殿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00084",
      "start_ms": 243590,
      "end_ms": 244935,
      "text": "您说这是景区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00085",
      "start_ms": 245540,
      "end_ms": 249065,
      "text": "还是老天爷在地上地下各藏了一座宝库？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00086",
      "start_ms": 249960,
      "end_ms": 250685,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00087",
      "start_ms": 251660,
      "end_ms": 260665,
      "text": "贵州安顺龙宫在贵州安顺这洞最绝的是它是中国第一水溶洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00088",
      "start_ms": 261230,
      "end_ms": 262685,
      "text": "全长十五公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00089",
      "start_ms": 263010,
      "end_ms": 264905,
      "text": "是中国最长的水溶洞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00090",
      "start_ms": 265430,
      "end_ms": 267330,
      "text": "水溶洞跟旱洞不一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00091",
      "start_ms": 267370,
      "end_ms": 268955,
      "text": "您得坐着船进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00092",
      "start_ms": 269640,
      "end_ms": 271005,
      "text": "船在暗河里走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00093",
      "start_ms": 271790,
      "end_ms": 275505,
      "text": "两边是各种奇形怪状的钟乳石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00094",
      "start_ms": 276390,
      "end_ms": 279870,
      "text": "头顶上终乳垂悬洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00095",
      "start_ms": 279910,
      "end_ms": 282015,
      "text": "里面还藏着一个瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00096",
      "start_ms": 282780,
      "end_ms": 284595,
      "text": "叫龙门飞瀑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00097",
      "start_ms": 285090,
      "end_ms": 287340,
      "text": "高五十米宽二十五米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00098",
      "start_ms": 287500,
      "end_ms": 289605,
      "text": "是中国最大的洞中瀑布。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00099",
      "start_ms": 290030,
      "end_ms": 294315,
      "text": "天池水从龙门倾泻而下声震山谷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00100",
      "start_ms": 294770,
      "end_ms": 295450,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00101",
      "start_ms": 295690,
      "end_ms": 297950,
      "text": "在地底下藏着一条河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00102",
      "start_ms": 298390,
      "end_ms": 299510,
      "text": "藏着一条瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00103",
      "start_ms": 299950,
      "end_ms": 301070,
      "text": "您坐在船上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00104",
      "start_ms": 301490,
      "end_ms": 304230,
      "text": "看着瀑布从洞里砸下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00105",
      "start_ms": 304750,
      "end_ms": 305230,
      "text": "您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00106",
      "start_ms": 305230,
      "end_ms": 308370,
      "text": "这是溶洞还是地底下的水帘洞？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00107",
      "start_ms": 308930,
      "end_ms": 309630,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00108",
      "start_ms": 309690,
      "end_ms": 314290,
      "text": "贵州双河洞在贵州绥阳这洞最绝的是它长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00109",
      "start_ms": 314770,
      "end_ms": 317150,
      "text": "根据最新发布的科考成果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00110",
      "start_ms": 317650,
      "end_ms": 322850,
      "text": "双河洞洞穴系统以探明总长度四百八十一公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00111",
      "start_ms": 323350,
      "end_ms": 326640,
      "text": "是亚洲第一长洞世界第三长洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00112",
      "start_ms": 327180,
      "end_ms": 330000,
      "text": "也是全球最长的白云岩洞穴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00113",
      "start_ms": 330580,
      "end_ms": 333240,
      "text": "洞穴系统有上百个洞口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00114",
      "start_ms": 333340,
      "end_ms": 334120,
      "text": "相互连通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00115",
      "start_ms": 334620,
      "end_ms": 336700,
      "text": "垂直落差九百多米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00116",
      "start_ms": 337400,
      "end_ms": 343760,
      "text": "它的长度从一九八七年的十七公里一路刷新到今天的四百八十一公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00117",
      "start_ms": 343980,
      "end_ms": 345680,
      "text": "到现在还没探到头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00118",
      "start_ms": 346400,
      "end_ms": 347060,
      "text": "专家说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00119",
      "start_ms": 347240,
      "end_ms": 348900,
      "text": "双河洞可能还会更长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00120",
      "start_ms": 349200,
      "end_ms": 352260,
      "text": "您想想一个洞探了快四十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00121",
      "start_ms": 352440,
      "end_ms": 355090,
      "text": "还没探完亚洲第一世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00122",
      "start_ms": 355090,
      "end_ms": 355490,
      "text": "第三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00123",
      "start_ms": 355670,
      "end_ms": 356975,
      "text": "您说这是溶洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00124",
      "start_ms": 357290,
      "end_ms": 361695,
      "text": "还是地球在贵州底下藏了一条走不完的地下长廊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00125",
      "start_ms": 361970,
      "end_ms": 363205,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00126",
      "start_ms": 363870,
      "end_ms": 365325,
      "text": "雪玉洞是个小姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00127",
      "start_ms": 365900,
      "end_ms": 370195,
      "text": "石花洞有八层楼、天权洞、地上地下都是宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00128",
      "start_ms": 370610,
      "end_ms": 373365,
      "text": "龙宫藏着中国最大的洞中瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00129",
      "start_ms": 373880,
      "end_ms": 376455,
      "text": "双河洞是亚洲第一程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00130",
      "start_ms": 377180,
      "end_ms": 379785,
      "text": "可这五个还不是最震撼的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00131",
      "start_ms": 380420,
      "end_ms": 382180,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00132",
      "start_ms": 382380,
      "end_ms": 383745,
      "text": "一个比一个狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00133",
      "start_ms": 384710,
      "end_ms": 389345,
      "text": "有一处地方整条江被一个洞吞进去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00134",
      "start_ms": 390290,
      "end_ms": 394955,
      "text": "有一处地方是中国唯一的世界自然遗产洞穴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00135",
      "start_ms": 396010,
      "end_ms": 402845,
      "text": "可他们还不是最狠的、最狠的那个被公认为中国溶洞的终极天花板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00136",
      "start_ms": 403280,
      "end_ms": 406755,
      "text": "肚子里锁着好几件天下独一份的地下之宝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00137",
      "start_ms": 407280,
      "end_ms": 411055,
      "text": "凡是亲眼见过的人出来都只剩一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00138",
      "start_ms": 411550,
      "end_ms": 414085,
      "text": "看过了它别的洞再入不了眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00139",
      "start_ms": 414420,
      "end_ms": 415100,
      "text": "他是哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00140",
      "start_ms": 415120,
      "end_ms": 416640,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00141",
      "start_ms": 416940,
      "end_ms": 418660,
      "text": "下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00142",
      "start_ms": 419120,
      "end_ms": 420800,
      "text": "您先点个关注点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_15779fc77ad73396_s00143",
      "start_ms": 420800,
      "end_ms": 422195,
      "text": "开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
